OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to convert chapel into home
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA church in a North Yorkshire village
OL,7,Fwill be converted into a residential
OL,8,Fproperty as it is no longer viable.
OL,10,FEvidence submitted by the Methodist
OL,11,FCircuit to North Yorkshire Council said
OL,12,Fthe chapel in Snainton, near
OL,13,FScarborough, has a congregation of only
OL,14,Feight members and an average worship
OL,15,Fattendance of only four to five people.
OL,17,FPlanners concluded that the conversion
OL,18,Fwould not result in an unacceptable
OL,19,Freduction in the provision of community
OL,20,For worship facilities available to
OL,21,Flocal residents.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
