OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to convert chapel into home
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuilt in 1895, the church will be
OL,7,Fturned into a three-bed house with an
OL,8,Finternal mezzanine with two of the
OL,9,Fbedrooms and a bathroom.
